      "comment": "DIOGO KEEPING (1) has been in sparkling form, last time showing blistering early pace and proving too slick around this track over 400m in 22.39, making it 10 wins on end. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Can continue on his winning ways. DAKOTA RYLEN (2) finished fourth last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 400m at this track, taking a Grade 5 in a head turning 22.67. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. RHINESTONE (6) has an excellent record here having never missed the placings in four starts, including two wins and two placings. Placed last time (19.95) at Angle Park in a Best 8, finishing third and beaten 8 lengths. Can feature in the finish. OUR IVIE ROSE (4) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
